{"id":"G5401","lemma":"φόβος","transliteration":"phobos","sayIt":"phobos","language":"Greek","partOfSpeech":"noun, masculine","gloss":"fear","meaning":"φόβος, -ου, ὁ\n[in LXX chiefly for יִרְאָה, also for פַּחַד, אֵימָה, etc. ;]\n1. in Hom., flight.\n2. That which causes flight, fear, dread, terror: Luk.1:12, Act.5:5, 1Ti.5:20. 1Jn.4:18, al.; cogn. accusative, φοβεῖσθαι φ., Mrk.4:41, Luk.2:9; with genitive obj., Jhn.7:13 19:33 20:19, Heb.2:5, 1Pe.3:14 (but cf. ICC, in l);ἀπὸ (τοῦ) φ., Mat.14:26, Luk.21:26; εἰς φ., Rom.8:15; μετὰ φόβου, Mat.28:8; φ. καὶ τρόμος (Lft., Notes, 172), 1Co.2:3, 2Co.7:15, Eph.6:5, Php.2:12; by meton., of that which causes fear, Rom.13:3; of reverential fear, Rom.13:7, 1Pe.1:17 2:18 3:2 3:15; τ. κυρίου, Act.9:31, 2Co.5:11 (see Field, Notes, 183); Χριστοῦ, Eph.5:21; θεοῦ, Rom.3:18, 2Co.7:1\nSYN.: see: δειλία (and of. DCG, i, 381) (AS)","glosses":["fear","awe","sense of awe","respect","overwhelmed with fear","terrified"],"count":43,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"mat-14","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"fear"}},{"chapterId":"mat-28","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"fear","kjv":"fear"}},{"chapterId":"mat-28","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"fear","kjv":"fear"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-4","v":41,"renderings":{"bsb":"Overwhelmed with fear","kjv":"exceedingly"}},{"chapterId":"luk-1","v":12,"renderings":{"bsb":"with fear","kjv":"fear"}},{"chapterId":"luk-1","v":65,"renderings":{"bsb":"awe","kjv":"fear"}},{"chapterId":"luk-2","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"they were terrified"}},{"chapterId":"luk-5","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"with awe","kjv":"with fear"}},{"chapterId":"luk-7","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"A sense of awe","kjv":"a fear"}},{"chapterId":"luk-8","v":37,"renderings":{"bsb":"fear","kjv":"fear"}},{"chapterId":"luk-21","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"fear","kjv":"fear"}},{"chapterId":"jhn-7","v":13,"renderings":{"bsb":"fear","kjv":"fear"}},{"chapterId":"jhn-19","v":38,"renderings":{"bsb":"fear","kjv":"fear"}},{"chapterId":"jhn-20","v":19,"renderings":{"bsb":"fear","kjv":"fea